{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>今日（14日）早上8時10分，警方接報指，觀塘游泳池一名60多歲女泳客被發現昏迷不醒，懷疑遇溺。事主獲救後，經由救護車送往聯合醫院搶救。意外起因仍有待調查。</p><figure><img alt=\"觀塘游泳池一名60多歲女泳客被發現昏迷不醒，懷疑遇溺。（資料圖片/蔡正邦攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20241108/931530795997204480298613.jpeg/n43BNkgMhQdl5Dfz-2SnPGe8p7UkvE7DFxuGpBcbhqQ\"/><figcaption>觀塘游泳池一名60多歲女泳客被發現昏迷不醒，懷疑遇溺。（資料圖片/蔡正邦攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"事主昏迷送往聯合醫院搶救。（資料圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250918/1045222967677554688765023.jpeg/mBADuQcjJxg6gE8ay-_bwjqp2cjwjsRzpEeVtJ5HlbQ\"/><figcaption>事主昏迷送往聯合醫院搶救。（資料圖片）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-14T00:57:08.016230+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":137,"images":2,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-14T00:43:49+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-14T01:10:46.374231+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-14T00:50:32.134501+00:00","content_hash":"a36d41c5f121cd1c7210eed5e8736c461315ccf3015e0670f67143da85a6a8e6","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}